mi_dv_km_s":57,"source":58},5.5,3.8,"NASA MER Press Kit (2003-06)",[60,65,70,75,79,83,87,91],{"met_days":61,"type":62,"label":63,"description":64},0,"launch","Launch — Delta II 7925","Cape Canaveral LC-17A, 2003-06-10. First of the twin Mars Exploration Rovers — Spirit (MER-A) leaves three weeks before its twin Opportunity (MER-B). Designed for a 90-Mars-sol primary mission; would survive 2,208 sols on the surface.",{"met_days":66,"type":67,"label":68,"description":69},0.005,"tli_or_tmi","Trans-Mars injection","PAM-D solid upper-stage burn sends Spirit on a 7-month Type-I transfer to Mars.",{"met_days":71,"type":72,"label":73,"description":74},15,"tcm","TCM-1","First mid-course correction. Removes launch dispersion.",{"met_days":76,"type":72,"label":77,"description":78},80,"TCM-2","Mid-cruise refinement.",{"met_days":80,"type":72,"label":81,"description":82},165,"TCM-3","Approach-phase trim toward Gusev Crater target ellipse.",{"met_days":84,"type":72,"label":85,"description":86},200,"TCM-4 — final pre-EDL","Final trim before the atmospheric entry interface.",{"met_days":12,"type":88,"label":89,"description":90},"arrival","Mars approach + cruise-stage separation","2004-01-04 UTC (the evening of 3 January in California). Cruise stage jettisoned 15 minutes before entry; backshell + heat shield + lander bounce-cushion entered Mars's atmosphere at 5.4 km/s.",{"met_days":92,"type":93,"label":94,"description":95},208.005,"edl_or_oi","Mars EDL — airbag landing in Gusev Crater","\"Six minutes from hell.\" Heat shield braked from 5.4 km/s to Mach 1.8; parachute deployed at 8.5 km altitude; retrorockets fired 12 m up; airbag-cocooned lander dropped, bounced 28 times across the crater floor, and rolled to a stop 250 m from its first impact at 14.57°S, 175.47°E in Gusev Crater. Spirit rolled off the lander petals twelve sols later. Found hematite-bearing rocks in the Columbia Hills suggesting persistent water. Stuck in soft sulphate-rich soil at \"Troy\" 2009-04; mission declared ended 2011-05-25.",{"source_tier":97,"reference_frame":98,"departure_body":99,"arrival_body":100,"transfer_type":101,"tcm_count":45,"waypoints_helio_au":102},"tier_1_5_hybrid","heliocentric_ecliptic_J2000","earth","mars","type1_lambert",[103,106,110,114,118,122,126,130,133,137,141,145,149,153,157,161,165,169,173,177,181,185,189,193,197,201,205,209,213,217,221,225,229,233,237,241,245,248,252,256,260,264,268,272,276,280,284,288,292,296,300,304,308,312,316,320,324,328,332,336,340,344,348,352,356,360,364,368,372,376,380,384,388,392,396,400,403,407,411,415,419,423,427,431,435,439,443,447,451,455,459,463,466,470,474,477,481,483,485,487],[61,104,61,105],-0.207064,-0.978327,[107,108,61,109],2.2061,-0.166517,-0.988149,[111,112,61,113],4.4122,-0.125742,-0.996662,[115,116,61,117],6.6183,-0.084793,-1.003801,[119,120,61,121],8.8245,-0.043714,-1.009407,[123,124,61,125],11.0306,-0.00258,-1.013701,[127,128,61,129],13.2367,0.038559,-1.016581,[71,131,61,132],0.071405,-1.01785,[134,135,61,136],17.6489,0.120627,-1.018153,[138,139,61,140],19.855,0.161442,-1.016871,[142,143,61,144],22.0611,0.202042,-1.01424,[146,147,61,148],24.2672,0.242399,-1.01038,[150,151,61,152],26.4734,0.282417,-1.005108,[154,155,61,156],28.6795,0.322089,-0.998607,[158,159,61,160],30.8856,0.361388,-0.990943,[162,163,61,164],33.0917,0.40019,-0.981916,[166,167,61,168],35.2978,0.438541,-0.971786,[170,171,61,172],37.5039,0.476385,-0.960531,[174,175,61,176],39.71,0.513628,-0.948062,[178,179,61,180],41.9162,0.550322,-0.934581,[182,183,61,184],44.1223,0.586386,-0.92003,[186,187,61,188],46.3284,0.621773,-0.904417,[190,191,61,192],48.5345,0.656531,-0.887886,[194,195,61,196],50.7406,0.690549,-0.870356,[198,199,61,200],52.9467,0.72384,-0.85191,[202,203,61,204],55.1528,0.756438,-0.832646,[206,207,61,208],57.359,0.7882,-0.812462,[210,211,61,212],59.5651,0.819208,-0.791502,[214,215,61,216],61.7712,0.849469,-0.769818,[218,219,61,220],63.9773,0.878822,-0.747311,[222,223,61,224],66.1834,0.907408,-0.724153,[226,227,61,228],68.3895